          <Text style={{ fontSize: 16.5, color: '#1E293B', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
            <span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold' }}>三 Worktree 并行研发</span>：前端/后端/DevOps 隔离修改，冲突生成工单，Git/SQLite 中断可恢复
