          </Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 12 }}>
          <Box style={{ width: 6, height: 6, borderRadius: 3, background: '#06B6D4', marginTop: 8 }} />
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 16.5, color: '#1E293B', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
            <span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold' }}>G3 失败必经恢复</span>：回滚与对账 → BLOCKED / NEEDS_RECONCILIATION；取消、巡检产生独立子 Run
          </Text>
